The variants in this library override Carbon's design tokens to express
alternative visual identities. Component foundations, accessibility, RTL,
motion, density, and i18n machinery are inherited from Carbon.

This product references typefaces from Adobe Fonts (Typekit) at runtime
when configured with the `adobe` font provider. Adobe Fonts terms apply
to font use; see https://fonts.adobe.com/legal.

References to design traditions and brands in variant names and
inspirations (Penguin Books, The Public Theater, Schiphol Airport, etc.)
are inspirational and do not imply affiliation, endorsement, or
trademark licensing.
